Model weights (Scout inference lineage)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Default Scout / Ollama model definitions in this monorepo use the Qwen3 family
(qwen3:8b and derived specialist / hermes-hc tags). Model weights are subject
to their upstream Qwen terms and are separate from this repository's Apache-2.0
source license. This monorepo does not distribute Meta Llama weights and does
not include a Llama Community License.

